        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K447-KIN, Crystal Kingsman Lever with Ornate Victorian Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Brass Accents, this ornate latchset features a beautiful and unique crystal lever. It is this Kingsman Lever that really brings out the grandeur of the Victorian Plate. Together, the Victorian Plate with Kingsman Lever is positively dripping with elegance. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/victorian-latchset-brass-accents-d05-k447\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K447-KIN Ornate Victorian Plate with Crystal Kingsman Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button and turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Plate with Kingsman Lever, Brass Accents D05-K447-KIN",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K447-KIN, Victorian Plate with Kingsman Lever - Made by Brass Accents, this ornate latchset features a beautiful and unique crystal lever. It is this Kingsman Lever that really brings out the grandeur of the Victorian Plate. Together, the Victorian Plate with Kingsman Lever is positively dripping with elegance. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
